OL,3,AMan charged with causing death by
OL,4,Adangerous driving over crash that
OL,5,Akilled 6
OL,6,
OL,7,FChristopher Cockell, 50, of Gresford
OL,8,FClose, Woolley Grange, is due to appear
OL,9,Fat Leeds Magistrates' Court on 28
OL,10,FOctober charged with six counts of
OL,11,Fcausing death by dangerous driving.
